+# Internal HTTP Policy
+
+The project's current recorded decision is HTTPS everywhere with no plaintext exception: plain HTTP is not permitted for any host, including internal ones. This supersedes an earlier allowance for plain HTTP on internal hosts, which is no longer in effect.
